# Night Mode on: the moon, just left of the icons beside the battery, which move up
# when shuffle or repeat is off. After them, as a viewport drawn later over another
# would wipe it on a full redraw, as at a track change, and with both on it stays
# left of the hold icon, clear of the titles, which are narrower for it.
